# 1D LUT — coarse lift curve, 4 entries
# Shadows raised to 0.25; midtones compressed; highlights at identity.
# 4 entries = maximum interpolation gaps; worst case for banding tests.
# Format: Iridas .cube, 1D, compatible with FFmpeg lut1d (cube format listed
# in art_01M6VT6K73PS2GJWYG5KT58HX0 r1 as a supported format).
LUT_1D_SIZE 4
0.250 0.250 0.250
0.500 0.500 0.500
0.750 0.750 0.750
1.000 1.000 1.000